WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.355
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:43.105 --> 01:45.905
Celestial Insurance's annual premium revenue is nearly 100 billion.

4
01:45.985 --> 01:48.145
Even if you come up with a dozen or two

5
01:48.225 --> 01:51.305
of these pet insurance scenarios,

6
01:51.385 --> 01:54.145
they can only generate at most several billion in premiums.

7
01:54.225 --> 01:55.585
What impact could that possibly have

8
01:55.665 --> 01:58.145
on Celestial Insurance's multi-billion-yuan business?

9
01:59.745 --> 02:01.745
I haven't collected enough materials.

10
02:01.825 --> 02:03.665
In that case,

11
02:03.745 --> 02:06.665
why did you tell Ma Ke you were confident in your proposal?

12
02:14.825 --> 02:18.145
The Celestial Insurance project has been dragging on for too long.

13
02:18.905 --> 02:20.385
Since the client wasn't happy with the first version,

14
02:20.465 --> 02:21.865
we can't just phone it in

15
02:21.945 --> 02:24.425
for the second proposal after all the time we've put in.

16
02:27.305 --> 02:30.105
These slides are all descriptive.

17
02:30.185 --> 02:32.145
No hard data to back them up.

18
02:32.745 --> 02:35.865
And there's no holistic view from the client's perspective!

19
02:37.745 --> 02:38.945
This isn't Maxmise's standard.

20
02:40.105 --> 02:42.105
-I'd like to explain. -Sorry.

21
02:42.905 --> 02:44.385
I don't want to waste everyone's time.

22
02:45.145 --> 02:48.745
Ma Ke, as the project manager, what's your take?

23
02:51.785 --> 02:52.705
Alright.

24
02:54.985 --> 02:56.545
NEXT STEPS

25
03:05.425 --> 03:06.625
Mr. Pi.

26
03:06.705 --> 03:08.425
My approach starts with the key value drivers

27
03:08.505 --> 03:09.745
of their current business.

28
03:09.825 --> 03:12.585
I built a value tree for Celestial Insurance.

29
03:19.545 --> 03:23.985
I re-identified the key value drivers of their current business.

30
03:24.585 --> 03:29.305
The focus is on using AI to optimize existing business processes.

31
03:48.465 --> 03:50.185
This proposal is far too complicated.

32
03:50.265 --> 03:53.265
I'd suggest redoing it with a focus

33
03:53.345 --> 03:55.745
on scenario-based big data business and enhancing the customer experience.

34
03:57.545 --> 03:59.745
Mr. Pi, this is my proposal.

35
04:04.265 --> 04:05.385
Ma Ke did a great job.

36
04:05.465 --> 04:06.865
Everyone, good work.

37
04:21.665 --> 04:23.585
Mr. Pi once told me a story.

38
04:23.665 --> 04:25.545
There was a herder out on the grassland,

39
04:25.625 --> 04:27.185
tending his sheep.

40
04:27.265 --> 04:29.465
Suddenly, a man showed up.

41
04:29.545 --> 04:31.985
He was wearing a shirt and tie, carrying a briefcase.

42
04:32.065 --> 04:33.465
He said to the herder,

43
04:33.545 --> 04:36.785
"Hey, sir. I can give you a high-end service.

44
04:37.985 --> 04:40.985
I just counted your sheep. You have 548."

45
04:41.905 --> 04:44.105
The herder said, "Yeah. How did you know?"

46
04:44.185 --> 04:47.425
The man said, "I just tapped into the satellite matrix up there.

47
04:47.505 --> 04:48.825
That's how I counted.

48
04:48.905 --> 04:52.225
So I'm taking this sheep as my service fee."

49
04:53.385 --> 04:54.865
Then the herder said, "Wait a minute.

50
04:55.785 --> 04:57.585
Are you a consultant?"

51
04:57.665 --> 04:59.705
The man was puzzled. He went, "How did you know?"

52
05:00.305 --> 05:03.105
"First, you showed up uninvited.

53
05:03.865 --> 05:07.585
Second, you told me data I already knew.

54
05:07.665 --> 05:09.865
Third, that's not a sheep you're holding.

55
05:09.945 --> 05:11.305
It's my dog."

56
05:13.145 --> 05:16.105
This is how ordinary people misunderstand us, consultants.

57
05:16.185 --> 05:19.225
They think we're just smooth talkers. Right?

58
05:19.305 --> 05:22.625
I'm sharing this story so you remember it

59
05:23.305 --> 05:24.745
as a cautionary tale.

60
05:26.305 --> 05:29.145
Don't let yourself become the main character in this story.

61
05:35.185 --> 05:36.025
Hot chocolate.

62
05:40.345 --> 05:41.385
Thanks.

63
05:42.785 --> 05:45.385
This kind of thing happens. I've been through it too.

64
05:46.945 --> 05:47.785
You have too?

65
05:48.825 --> 05:49.945
That's just how Ma Ke is.

66
05:50.025 --> 05:52.105
He used to be pretty good at his job,

67
05:52.185 --> 05:54.145
but over the last couple of years, with more going on at home,

68
05:54.225 --> 05:55.745
his focus hasn't been on work.

69
05:55.825 --> 05:57.785
He often takes credit for our work.

70
05:57.865 --> 05:59.745
But he's good at networking.

71
05:59.825 --> 06:03.305
Most of Celestial Insurance's projects came from him drinking with clients.

72
06:04.065 --> 06:06.465
That's why he's still at this company.

73
06:07.185 --> 06:09.465
The project progress has been poor lately.

74
06:09.545 --> 06:11.625
He probably figured Mr. Pi would be back early,

75
06:11.705 --> 06:13.705
so he took your proposal and passed it off as his own.

76
06:13.785 --> 06:15.345
And none of you ever pushed back?

77
06:16.145 --> 06:17.625
Some people did object to his ways before,

78
06:17.705 --> 06:19.105
but they got pushed out pretty quickly.

79
06:20.065 --> 06:21.665
I've been with Ma Ke since I joined the company.

80
06:21.745 --> 06:22.865
I know him too well.

81
06:22.945 --> 06:24.705
He's not a good person,

82
06:24.785 --> 06:26.705
but the bonuses he gives out are generous.

83
06:28.025 --> 06:29.705
Among the new hires, he wouldn't dare touch Bu Tianna,

84
06:29.785 --> 06:30.985
so he targeted you.

85
06:31.065 --> 06:34.585
He set a trap to humiliate you in public.

86
06:34.665 --> 06:36.625
Then, while you're still processing it,

87
06:36.705 --> 06:38.745
he takes your proposal to Mr. Pi and gets the credit.

88
06:38.825 --> 06:43.185
After a maneuver like that, most people just have to swallow it.

89
06:44.465 --> 06:46.625
But I don't want to be one of the silent majority.

90
06:48.185 --> 06:49.825
Sorry, I didn't warn you sooner.

91
06:51.025 --> 06:53.305
But you know the saying, "If you don't bend, you break."

92
06:54.185 --> 06:56.265
Lin Long is already on leave.

93
06:56.345 --> 06:58.185
What happens if you go to war with your direct supervisor?

94
06:58.265 --> 06:59.585
Who do you think the company will side with?

95
07:00.385 --> 07:02.225
Knowing Ma Ke,

96
07:02.305 --> 07:04.185
he probably left no evidence for you to hold onto.

97
07:06.025 --> 07:07.465
Right.

98
07:07.545 --> 07:09.385
That night, everyone else had gone home,

99
07:09.465 --> 07:10.665
so there were no witnesses,

100
07:10.745 --> 07:12.625
and he just borrowed my ideas.

101
07:12.705 --> 07:14.305
He never asked for the original slide files,

102
07:14.385 --> 07:16.105
so there's no physical evidence either.

103
07:16.185 --> 07:18.705
Even if I made a scene, he'd just say it was

104
07:18.785 --> 07:21.585
a similar line of thinking that came out of our team discussions. Right?

105
07:22.745 --> 07:24.585
So I just have to accept it.

106
07:25.185 --> 07:29.025
So we can't lose this job over a moment of anger.

107
07:32.225 --> 07:33.065
Don't be upset.

108
07:34.145 --> 07:35.585
The world is just that harsh.

109
07:40.305 --> 07:41.145
Is it?

110
08:02.705 --> 08:05.065
Such simple slides.

111
08:05.145 --> 08:07.025
Not like your usual style.

112
08:09.505 --> 08:10.785
Just a stumble.

113
08:11.905 --> 08:14.425
The final team review isn't due yet anyway.

114
08:14.505 --> 08:16.825
I'll redo the proposal with a new angle.

115
08:16.905 --> 08:17.985
I might still beat you.

116
08:18.985 --> 08:22.625
I'm going to talk to the CEO's office now to reschedule the interviews.

117
08:22.705 --> 08:24.985
Did Ma Ke do something?

118
08:25.065 --> 08:27.985
Is that why you got so worked up at the weekly meeting?

119
08:29.865 --> 08:33.545
No. I just wasn't good enough.

120
08:33.625 --> 08:34.664
I'm off.

121
08:35.985 --> 08:37.585
Then try to outdo me!

122
08:39.825 --> 08:42.225
Hello, Ms. Yu. I'm Xu Chi from Maxmise.

123
08:42.305 --> 08:43.144
Have a seat.

124
08:43.904 --> 08:45.665
Thank you so much for coming today.

125
08:46.265 --> 08:48.385
Of all the people Ma Ke has wronged,

126
08:48.465 --> 08:50.585
she's recovered the fastest.

127
08:50.665 --> 08:53.425
She's someone who can achieve great things.

128
08:53.505 --> 08:54.865
You bet.

129
09:02.985 --> 09:04.665
Didn't we already send you the reports?

130
09:04.745 --> 09:06.905
Yes. We've read the reports.

131
09:06.985 --> 09:08.785
But they don't go deep enough.

132
09:08.865 --> 09:11.385
So we wanted to dig into the real pain points

133
09:11.465 --> 09:13.585
of frontline business leaders like you, Ms. Yu.

134
09:15.025 --> 09:18.345
The real pain point is you guys constantly bothering us.

135
09:18.425 --> 09:20.065
Business folks are busy.

136
09:20.705 --> 09:23.385
One call from headquarters, and they pull us in from the branches.

137
09:23.465 --> 09:26.545
All kinds of interviews, meetings, and training.

138
09:27.385 --> 09:29.385
Come on, we all have sales targets to hit.

139
09:29.465 --> 09:31.505
We don't have time to sit around chatting with you.

140
09:32.105 --> 09:34.105
How about this? Let me speed things up.

141
09:34.185 --> 09:35.985
I'll only take half an hour of your time, alright?

142
09:40.545 --> 09:42.145
-Ten minutes. -Okay.

143
09:43.825 --> 09:46.065
From a practical business perspective,

144
09:46.145 --> 09:48.665
which scenarios or functions does your department

145
09:48.745 --> 09:50.825
need digital transformation in the most?

146
09:50.905 --> 09:52.785
How would I know?

147
09:52.865 --> 09:55.425
Our branch staff doesn't have that high an education level.

148
09:55.505 --> 09:57.905
They wouldn't understand all that digital stuff.

149
09:58.505 --> 09:59.425
You don't have to be that specific.

150
09:59.505 --> 10:02.425
Just give me a general sense.

151
10:06.425 --> 10:07.905
Your nose is bleeding.

152
10:09.465 --> 10:10.385
-Take it. -Thanks.

153
10:11.345 --> 10:12.785
Don't tilt your head up. Keep it down.

154
10:13.985 --> 10:15.305
Give me your hand.

155
10:15.385 --> 10:16.625
-Here. -No, it's fine.

156
10:16.705 --> 10:17.665
Don't worry.

157
10:17.745 --> 10:20.385
I used to get nosebleeds all the time too. I'd just pinch right here.

158
10:20.465 --> 10:21.985
The bleeding would stop in a bit.

159
10:28.425 --> 10:29.665
Did I pinch too hard?

160
10:30.265 --> 10:31.585
Bear with it.

161
10:34.265 --> 10:36.945
Have… Have you been wronged?

162
10:37.665 --> 10:40.265
Is it work or your boyfriend?

163
10:43.145 --> 10:44.705
I've been there.

164
10:44.785 --> 10:46.785
This is not just due to getting overheated.

165
10:46.865 --> 10:49.865
This is you being pushed around and holding it all inside.

166
10:49.945 --> 10:52.545
But you just have to take it.

167
10:52.625 --> 10:55.265
Once the tears and blood are out,

168
10:55.345 --> 10:56.305
the anger settles.

169
10:56.985 --> 10:59.705
There'll always be a chance to get even later.

170
11:00.305 --> 11:01.145
Thanks.

171
11:01.905 --> 11:02.785
Don't mention it.

172
11:02.865 --> 11:05.265
Let's see. Did it stop?

173
11:09.305 --> 11:10.305
Young lady…

174
11:14.065 --> 11:16.785
I'm so sorry. I… I took up so much of your time.

175
11:16.865 --> 11:18.385
Let's continue.

176
11:19.985 --> 11:20.825
Xu.

177
11:22.025 --> 11:24.905
Take my advice. You're not happy in this job anyway,

178
11:24.985 --> 11:27.785
and I really need to get back to the branch.

179
11:27.865 --> 11:30.025
Let's not waste any more time. Alright?

180
11:30.865 --> 11:31.705
How about this?

181
11:31.785 --> 11:33.905
Just ride with me back to the branch.

182
11:33.985 --> 11:35.265
We can talk on the way.

183
11:35.345 --> 11:37.425
Sort out our thoughts properly.

184
11:37.505 --> 11:39.665
It's better than flailing around like headless chickens right now.

185
11:40.745 --> 11:42.585
-I… -Let's go.

186
11:57.225 --> 11:58.945
-Thanks. -No problem.

187
12:02.745 --> 12:03.865
Xu.

188
12:03.945 --> 12:05.625
After talking with you the whole way,

189
12:05.705 --> 12:08.745
I can tell you're not the type to put on airs.

190
12:09.585 --> 12:11.425
Let me give you a heads-up.

191
12:12.025 --> 12:13.345
No matter how many times you redo it,

192
12:13.425 --> 12:15.825
Maxmise's proposal won't get approved.

193
12:15.905 --> 12:17.985
So don't waste too much effort on it.

194
12:18.065 --> 12:19.225
Why?

195
12:36.905 --> 12:38.745
NO. 92, YONG'AN ROAD

196
12:52.745 --> 12:56.465
XU CHI LOVES MOM

197
13:04.345 --> 13:05.185
Mom.

198
13:08.505 --> 13:10.545
I got bullied at work today.

199
13:12.025 --> 13:14.825
These slides are all descriptive.

200
13:14.905 --> 13:16.865
No hard data to back them up.

201
13:16.945 --> 13:18.945
-I'd like to explain. -Sorry.

202
13:19.785 --> 13:21.065
I don't want to waste everyone's time.

203
13:21.945 --> 13:24.785
I even cried in front of other people.

204
13:24.865 --> 13:26.065
So embarrassing.

205
13:26.745 --> 13:29.825
This is you being pushed around and holding it all inside.

206
13:30.465 --> 13:34.065
Once the tears and blood are out, the anger settles.

207
13:34.945 --> 13:37.745
There'll always be a chance to get even later.

208
13:41.465 --> 13:43.865
Mom, go beat him up for me. Alright?

209
13:47.225 --> 13:50.185
Xu. Don't be too upset.

210
13:53.625 --> 13:56.665
My colleagues all know how attached you are to this place.

211
13:56.745 --> 14:00.185
But sometimes these things just come down to timing.

212
14:03.185 --> 14:04.745
Huang didn't tell you?

213
14:04.825 --> 14:06.305
The owner of Unit 201 was willing to sell.

214
14:06.385 --> 14:07.745
It was sold last Tuesday.

215
14:09.345 --> 14:10.345
Sold?

216
14:11.065 --> 14:11.905
‎Yes.

217
14:14.465 --> 14:16.145
Unit 201 was sold?

218
14:16.225 --> 14:17.505
Huang never told me.

219
14:17.585 --> 14:18.465
Where is he?

220
14:18.545 --> 14:20.625
He took his commission and quit. Went back to his hometown.

221
14:20.705 --> 14:22.665
Our industry has high turnover.

222
14:26.945 --> 14:28.385
Xu… Are you okay? You…

223
14:28.465 --> 14:29.985
Please don't scare me like that.

224
14:33.425 --> 14:35.585
NO. 92, YONG'AN ROAD

225
14:42.625 --> 14:43.745
Have some water.

226
14:48.305 --> 14:49.625
Was it really sold?

227
14:50.225 --> 14:52.225
This is the place I've been waiting for.

228
14:52.305 --> 14:53.745
It's my mom's old apartment.

229
14:53.825 --> 14:56.745
I didn't even get a chance to see it inside,

230
14:56.825 --> 14:57.745
and it's gone.

231
14:58.385 --> 14:59.785
The contract has been signed online.

232
14:59.865 --> 15:01.025
Please don't be too upset.

233
15:01.625 --> 15:03.185
I've been thinking about it for you.

234
15:03.265 --> 15:05.665
Once his kid gets into school, he'll probably sell.

235
15:05.745 --> 15:07.745
We're the only agency at this entrance.

236
15:07.825 --> 15:09.585
He'll have to list with us when the time comes.

237
15:09.665 --> 15:11.265
I'll keep an eye out for you.

238
15:11.345 --> 15:14.025
The market is still trending down anyway.

239
15:14.105 --> 15:15.265
Once you have the funds ready,

240
15:15.345 --> 15:19.905
I can offer a little above market and get Unit 201 back for you.

241
15:19.985 --> 15:22.065
-Really? -Really.

242
15:22.145 --> 15:23.985
Then I'm counting on you.

243
15:24.065 --> 15:26.385
As soon as I have the money, I'm buying it.

244
15:26.465 --> 15:27.665
I'll get you a nice big bonus when it's done.

245
15:27.745 --> 15:28.985
Xu, actually,

246
15:29.065 --> 15:31.945
-there are similar units upstairs-- -I don't want those. I only want this one.

247
15:32.705 --> 15:34.705
Alright. Let me add you on WeChat.

248
15:34.785 --> 15:36.705
Let me know if anything comes up, okay?

249
15:37.425 --> 15:38.705
-Wait-- -Scan my QR code.

250
15:38.785 --> 15:40.345
Please, just do me a favor.

251
15:40.425 --> 15:42.385
Just come look at a few places with me.

252
15:42.465 --> 15:43.545
It's almost the end of the month.

253
15:43.625 --> 15:45.185
If I don't hit my showing quota,

254
15:45.265 --> 15:47.305
I'll lose my performance bonus.

255
15:51.185 --> 15:53.505
Xu, you're so kind.

256
15:53.585 --> 15:55.625
I'll make sure to keep an eye on Unit 201 for you.

257
15:57.505 --> 15:59.265
Our line of work isn't easy.

258
15:59.345 --> 16:02.025
Door-knocking, showings, and meetings every day.

259
16:02.105 --> 16:04.345
I thought it'd be easier than selling insurance.

260
16:05.945 --> 16:07.665
You used to sell insurance?

261
16:07.745 --> 16:09.465
Yeah. I was a top agent.

262
16:09.545 --> 16:10.865
Deputy director of the sales branch.

263
16:10.945 --> 16:12.825
I even qualified for the Million Dollar Round Table.

264
16:12.905 --> 16:13.865
BLESSING

265
16:13.945 --> 16:14.945
You're pulling my leg.

266
16:15.025 --> 16:19.505
A branch director makes at least 200,000 a year.

267
16:19.585 --> 16:20.945
Why switch to real estate?

268
16:23.625 --> 16:26.585
Look. This is me at the awards ceremony.

269
16:26.665 --> 16:27.985
I just had bad luck.

270
16:28.065 --> 16:31.345
I set up a slush fund in my department and got caught. They fired me.

271
16:33.865 --> 16:34.945
You're from Celestial?

272
16:36.865 --> 16:38.905
We went to their company, but they wouldn't agree,

273
16:38.985 --> 16:40.465
and they wouldn't say why.

274
16:40.545 --> 16:43.265
We went to Ms. Yu, and she wouldn't agree either.

275
16:43.905 --> 16:45.705
Xu, you came to the right person.

276
16:45.785 --> 16:48.105
You know why Ms. Yu says no proposal will ever get approved?

277
16:48.185 --> 16:50.585
Because the business side at Celestial will never agree!

278
16:50.665 --> 16:51.505
Why?

279
16:52.425 --> 16:55.265
Seventy percent of Celestial's employees are salespeople out in the field.

280
16:55.345 --> 16:58.105
Combining letters and reports has already cut everyone's commissions.

281
16:58.185 --> 16:59.905
If they go digital, they'll have to share data for free.

282
16:59.985 --> 17:01.545
That's basically giving away all their hard-earned

283
17:01.625 --> 17:03.225
business resources to others.

284
17:03.305 --> 17:04.825
And once it's digitalized,

285
17:04.905 --> 17:06.704
it'll probably all go to the Internet Business Division.

286
17:06.785 --> 17:08.184
They have separate accounting.

287
17:08.265 --> 17:10.464
That's essentially taking money from other divisions.

288
17:10.545 --> 17:13.105
For that reason alone, Ms. Yu and her people won't like you.

289
17:16.224 --> 17:20.585
So at Celestial, aside from the executives close to the CEO,

290
17:20.665 --> 17:24.025
most employees actually don't want digital transformation?

291
17:25.065 --> 17:27.704
At least when I was there, that's how everyone felt.

292
17:28.424 --> 17:29.945
Their boss hired you, consultants.

293
17:30.025 --> 17:31.865
No one dares to object openly,

294
17:31.945 --> 17:34.185
so they find ways during review meetings.

295
17:34.265 --> 17:36.505
Version one doesn't sit well with one set of branches,

296
17:36.585 --> 17:38.705
and version two gets shot down by the rest.

297
17:40.065 --> 17:40.905
I get it.

298
17:43.345 --> 17:45.585
Maybe I can take back what's mine soon.

299
17:49.465 --> 17:51.785
You sure you want to work alongside the salespeople?

300
17:51.865 --> 17:52.985
I'm sure.

301
17:53.065 --> 17:54.825
Whatever they do, I do.

302
17:54.905 --> 17:58.905
From field agent sales to internal claims and underwriting,

303
17:58.985 --> 18:00.985
I'll spend at least three days in each department.

304
18:01.065 --> 18:02.305
That's the only way I can figure out

305
18:02.385 --> 18:04.145
the business pain points you can't put into words.

306
18:05.545 --> 18:07.225
You sure talk big.

307
18:07.305 --> 18:08.785
But these are tough jobs.

308
18:08.865 --> 18:10.825
Don't come crying when you get burnt out.

309
18:12.145 --> 18:14.385
Still, tears from pushing myself

310
18:14.465 --> 18:15.945
are better than those from being pushed around.

311
18:17.185 --> 18:18.585
I'll get some veterans to show you the ropes.

312
18:25.185 --> 18:27.065
HOME INSURANCE PROTECTING EVERY CORNER OF YOUR HOME

313
18:40.305 --> 18:41.745
-Let's bike. -Okay.

314
19:32.345 --> 19:33.385
Go MIA again?

315
19:36.305 --> 19:38.745
Sorry. I've been buried in the project all week,

316
19:38.825 --> 19:40.105
working around the clock.

317
19:40.185 --> 19:41.345
My phone died.

318
19:42.425 --> 19:43.745
You're busier than me now.

319
19:43.825 --> 19:44.945
How's the project going?

320
19:45.025 --> 19:47.465
Did you have your internal proposal review meeting yet?

321
19:47.545 --> 19:48.465
‎YE XINZHI, XU CHI

322
19:48.545 --> 19:50.265
It went pretty well.

323
19:50.345 --> 19:51.785
What did you need?

324
19:54.865 --> 19:57.225
-Are you off work? -Yes.

325
20:08.065 --> 20:09.945
-Hello? -Hello.

326
20:12.625 --> 20:16.265
The project's on track, so I didn't mention it.

327
20:16.865 --> 20:18.225
I'm really fine.

328
20:18.825 --> 20:21.345
I'm at the hotel right now,

329
20:21.425 --> 20:23.425
munching on chips and drinking cola.

330
20:24.025 --> 20:25.545
I've been to your place before.

331
20:25.625 --> 20:26.785
Not a single snack in sight.

332
20:26.865 --> 20:29.025
And you don't usually snack anyway.

333
20:29.105 --> 20:30.025
Are you lying to me?

334
20:31.585 --> 20:33.865
I really am at a hotel. I'm really fine.

335
20:34.905 --> 20:38.305
Given your track record of running off in the middle of the night,

336
20:38.385 --> 20:39.385
your credibility is low.

337
20:40.625 --> 20:41.465
Switch to video.

338
20:42.785 --> 20:44.065
No, no.

339
20:44.145 --> 20:46.025
My room is a mess.

340
20:46.105 --> 20:46.985
Xu Chi.

341
20:47.585 --> 20:50.105
Where are you really? Why are you being so evasive?

342
20:54.545 --> 20:55.385
Give me a minute.

343
21:13.705 --> 21:16.385
See? I'm at a hotel, right?

344
21:17.105 --> 21:17.945
I see it.

345
21:18.025 --> 21:19.745
I'm not lying to you.

346
21:20.385 --> 21:21.945
Why don't you believe me?

347
21:22.025 --> 21:25.185
Sorry. I was just a little worried about you.

348
21:25.825 --> 21:28.105
Something about the way you were talking felt off.

349
21:28.185 --> 21:29.705
Is there a problem with the project?

350
21:30.905 --> 21:34.545
I didn't want to tell you because if I did,

351
21:34.625 --> 21:36.665
you'd definitely try to help me figure it out.

352
21:37.265 --> 21:38.905
But you can't mentor me forever.

353
21:39.625 --> 21:43.545
So this time, I want to try handling it all on my own.

354
21:44.665 --> 21:46.625
-Think your wings are fully grown? -No.

355
21:46.705 --> 21:49.625
I almost had my feathers plucked a few days ago.

356
21:50.225 --> 21:52.785
It was just so embarrassing. I didn't want you to see.

357
21:53.385 --> 21:54.345
So humiliating.

358
21:54.425 --> 21:55.425
How humiliating?

359
21:57.385 --> 22:00.985
Humiliating enough that I cried in front of someone.

360
22:04.585 --> 22:09.585
But experience comes from lessons learned.

361
22:09.665 --> 22:12.785
The hurdles I'm facing now will become my greatest assets.

362
22:12.865 --> 22:14.625
Once I get over this mountain,

363
22:14.705 --> 22:16.465
I'll be unstoppable. Right?

364
22:19.025 --> 22:20.105
You're pretty confident.

365
22:21.225 --> 22:22.425
Guess I was worrying for nothing.

366
22:23.345 --> 22:25.265
Just in case… I mean, just in case.

367
22:25.345 --> 22:28.505
If you ever need help, come to me anytime.

368
22:29.105 --> 22:30.465
Forget it.

369
22:30.545 --> 22:33.265
I don't want to be a third wheel between you and all those women.

370
22:35.265 --> 22:37.105
XIAOXI

371
22:40.105 --> 22:41.185
Hello, Xinzhi.

372
22:41.265 --> 22:43.465
Ms. Liu, hold on a second. I have…

373
22:43.545 --> 22:44.465
I'm off.

374
22:47.385 --> 22:50.905
Is that why you haven't been contacting me lately?

375
23:07.385 --> 23:09.145
Ye Xinzhi, do you really…

376
23:14.185 --> 23:15.785
not have that kind of feelings for me?

377
23:28.665 --> 23:30.145
What did you just say? Bad signal.

378
23:33.345 --> 23:34.345
Nothing.

379
23:35.745 --> 23:39.665
I just meant, uh,

380
23:39.745 --> 23:42.185
if you keep ruining people's plans, karma will come for you.

381
23:42.825 --> 23:46.625
I wouldn't want that to mess up my own love life.

382
23:46.705 --> 23:50.465
And lately, I've been handling basic business

383
23:50.545 --> 23:52.385
with Celestial's salespeople.

384
23:52.465 --> 23:54.385
If you have new work for me,

385
23:54.465 --> 23:56.065
I probably won't be able to do it.

386
23:57.385 --> 24:00.225
Okay. I'll be away on business for a few days.

387
24:00.305 --> 24:02.665
So I'll give you some time off. Good luck.

388
24:04.305 --> 24:05.345
You too.

389
24:14.665 --> 24:16.465
Love life?

390
24:24.945 --> 24:26.545
Can't keep going like this.

391
24:30.105 --> 24:31.625
Absolutely cannot.

392
24:39.225 --> 24:40.105
CELESTIAL INSURANCE CONSULTING PROPOSAL INTERNAL SELECTION

393
24:40.185 --> 24:41.025
BU TIANNA: 4 VOTES

394
24:41.105 --> 24:42.465
Zhou Sen got one vote.

395
24:43.465 --> 24:44.585
Yang Rui got two votes.

396
24:45.905 --> 24:46.945
Bu Tianna got…

397
24:50.585 --> 24:51.945
four votes.

398
24:52.025 --> 24:53.625
Alright. Let's hear it.

399
24:53.705 --> 24:55.505
Why did you all choose Bu Tianna's proposal?

400
24:56.145 --> 24:58.145
Her data is very detailed.

401
24:58.785 --> 25:01.545
The overall internet transformation budget is reduced by 30%.

402
25:01.625 --> 25:03.585
One reason Celestial rejected the previous proposal

403
25:03.665 --> 25:05.225
was that the budget was too high.

404
25:05.305 --> 25:07.745
I think this one will definitely work.

405
25:08.825 --> 25:10.705
Okay. Since it's the group's choice,

406
25:10.785 --> 25:12.545
let's have Tianna present!

407
25:16.985 --> 25:18.505
INTELLIGENT UNDERWRITING &amp; CLAIMS MVP SOLUTION

408
25:30.505 --> 25:31.385
Not bad.

409
25:33.465 --> 25:34.545
-Mr. Zheng. -Mr. Zheng. We still--

410
25:37.145 --> 25:39.705
Now, I'd like to present Plan B to everyone.

411
25:43.785 --> 25:45.305
Xu Chi, you--

412
25:58.105 --> 26:00.185
You…

413
26:00.945 --> 26:02.625
Speak up a little, okay?

414
26:03.225 --> 26:04.145
The people in the back can't hear you.

415
26:04.225 --> 26:06.505
A good proposal needs to be heard by everyone.

416
26:06.585 --> 26:07.705
Okay.

417
26:08.865 --> 26:11.265
Today, I'm only going to speak plainly.

418
26:12.065 --> 26:14.465
If we went with last month's old proposal,

419
26:14.545 --> 26:17.865
Celestial's annual premium growth could hit 20%,

420
26:17.945 --> 26:20.705
but it would also cut commissions in half

421
26:20.785 --> 26:25.145
for agents and salespeople with below-median KPIs.

422
26:25.225 --> 26:26.665
But this proposal aims

423
26:26.745 --> 26:30.225
to boost Celestial's annual premium growth to 30%,

424
26:30.305 --> 26:32.465
while also increasing

425
26:32.545 --> 26:34.985
salespeople's income by 10% annually.

426
26:36.305 --> 26:38.465
You probably think I'm selling you a pipe dream, right?

427
26:38.545 --> 26:40.865
Because I know that to many people,

428
26:40.945 --> 26:42.745
consultants are just smooth talkers.

429
26:43.985 --> 26:46.825
But I'm pretty confident in my proposal,

430
26:46.905 --> 26:49.385
so give me half an hour.

431
26:49.465 --> 26:51.145
Hear me out before you decide to tear into me.

432
26:53.105 --> 26:54.745
Okay. Let's get started.

433
26:54.825 --> 26:59.225
To be fair, our previous versions weren't bad.

434
26:59.305 --> 27:01.505
So why, after so many iterations,

435
27:01.585 --> 27:03.665
has Celestial's acceptance remained low?

436
27:04.265 --> 27:06.505
We've actually been thinking it over and reflecting on it since we got back.

437
27:06.585 --> 27:09.625
After the whole team's on-the-ground research,

438
27:09.705 --> 27:11.345
we finally figured out the problem.

439
27:12.065 --> 27:14.305
If Celestial actually accepted our proposal,

440
27:14.385 --> 27:17.625
it would mean opening up all your business data to Maxmise.

441
27:17.705 --> 27:19.985
That would certainly be a big win for Maxmise,

442
27:20.065 --> 27:23.825
but for Celestial, there's real risk.

443
27:23.905 --> 27:27.545
That has been a hidden concern for your senior leadership.

444
27:27.625 --> 27:29.545
And for the sales side,

445
27:29.625 --> 27:32.745
everyone's worried about things like, once they go digital,

446
27:32.825 --> 27:33.985
how much departmental profit

447
27:34.065 --> 27:35.585
would get taken by the Internet Business Division,

448
27:35.665 --> 27:37.905
and whether they'd be able to keep their own clients.

449
27:37.985 --> 27:38.825
Don't worry, everyone.

450
27:38.905 --> 27:42.265
Because what we're doing for Celestial this time isn't about subtraction.

451
27:42.345 --> 27:43.265
It's about addition.

452
28:09.985 --> 28:12.345
In short, the new app,

453
28:12.425 --> 28:14.225
the digital marketing content center,

454
28:14.305 --> 28:17.145
and the Agent Cooperation Network being built on the middle platform

455
28:17.225 --> 28:18.865
are all traffic and efficiency tools

456
28:18.945 --> 28:21.425
that frontline salespeople can actually use.

457
28:22.025 --> 28:23.065
Let me wrap this up in a nutshell.

458
28:23.145 --> 28:25.265
The digital transformation this time

459
28:25.345 --> 28:26.905
isn't about making things harder for everyone.

460
28:26.985 --> 28:29.585
It's about helping you close deals and make money.

461
28:47.025 --> 28:49.345
THANK YOU FOR LISTENING

462
28:50.345 --> 28:51.505
Now that's the right approach.

463
28:51.585 --> 28:53.985
The earlier proposals were like listening to Greek.

464
28:59.785 --> 29:03.705
Mr. Pi, today's proposal was excellent.

465
29:03.785 --> 29:05.785
We'll go back and study it carefully

466
29:05.865 --> 29:07.545
-and get back to you soon. -Alright.

467
29:07.625 --> 29:09.465
Especially Miss Xu.

468
29:09.545 --> 29:11.865
Her proposal was very solid.

469
29:11.945 --> 29:13.145
You flatter me.

470
29:13.225 --> 29:15.985
This proposal reflects the consensus of the entire project team.

471
29:16.065 --> 29:18.105
I was just the presenter.

472
29:18.705 --> 29:20.425
But you're the one who spent

473
29:20.505 --> 29:22.185
over two weeks working alongside our salespeople.

474
29:22.865 --> 29:24.985
-Mr. Zheng, I have to be honest with you. -Oh?

475
29:25.065 --> 29:27.865
Consulting firms have worked with Celestial quite a bit,

476
29:27.945 --> 29:31.465
but Miss Xu is the most hands-on person I've ever seen.

477
29:31.545 --> 29:33.065
-Exactly. -Most importantly,

478
29:33.145 --> 29:34.145
Miss Xu speaks in plain language.

479
29:34.225 --> 29:36.545
Everyone can understand what she says.

480
29:36.625 --> 29:38.105
I'm just a translator.

481
29:38.185 --> 29:39.545
I took Mr. Pi and Ma Ke's ideas

482
29:39.625 --> 29:40.865
and put them in simple terms.

483
29:40.945 --> 29:42.625
Everyone helped me a lot.

484
29:43.385 --> 29:45.505
Xu Chi, look at all this praise.

485
29:45.585 --> 29:46.745
I need to remind you of something.

486
29:46.825 --> 29:48.465
This is just the first step of a long journey.

487
29:48.545 --> 29:50.985
A project this big requires careful attention. Okay?

488
29:51.065 --> 29:51.985
Can't afford any mistakes.

489
29:52.065 --> 29:53.585
If something goes wrong… Right?

490
29:53.665 --> 29:56.465
-Mr. Pi, the follow-up-- -Ma Ke has a point.

491
29:56.545 --> 29:58.305
If anything goes wrong…

492
30:01.945 --> 30:03.025
deduct his pay.

493
30:03.905 --> 30:04.905
Mr. Zheng, after you.

494
30:14.545 --> 30:15.745
Thank you for giving me the opportunity.

495
30:16.945 --> 30:18.385
You earned the opportunity yourself.

496
30:19.385 --> 30:20.305
No need to thank me.

497
30:21.825 --> 30:23.905
The slides you praised Ma Ke for that day

498
30:23.985 --> 30:26.905
were almost identical to what I'd shown him the night before.

499
30:26.985 --> 30:29.185
And after he saw my presentation,

500
30:29.265 --> 30:32.065
he assigned me to work on a completely new, unfamiliar proposal.

501
30:32.665 --> 30:35.345
That's why I performed so poorly at the meeting that day.

502
30:37.145 --> 30:38.745
I pretended I couldn't find something.

503
30:39.625 --> 30:40.705
Where is it?

504
30:41.505 --> 30:42.865
I left it right on the desk.

505
30:42.945 --> 30:44.865
Zhao Heng, have you seen my USB drive?

506
30:44.945 --> 30:46.665
USB drive? What color?

507
30:47.265 --> 30:49.185
The yellow one.

508
30:49.265 --> 30:50.945
I remember putting it in that box.

509
30:51.025 --> 30:52.505
How is it not there?

510
30:56.265 --> 30:57.105
Found it?

511
30:57.185 --> 30:59.745
Just a girl who panics over a little criticism.

512
30:59.825 --> 31:02.425
I was worried she might push back after being set up,

513
31:02.505 --> 31:04.305
but she's even more timid than I thought.

514
31:04.385 --> 31:05.265
MA KE

515
31:05.785 --> 31:07.305
I asked Security for the footage

516
31:07.385 --> 31:09.945
and gathered the evidence while Ma Ke wasn't on guard.

517
31:10.025 --> 31:13.265
But Mr. Pi, I'm not here to complain.

518
31:15.225 --> 31:17.225
I'm here to fight for a chance.

519
31:20.105 --> 31:22.185
This is the first draft of a new proposal I developed independently.

520
31:22.265 --> 31:23.385
Please take a look.

521
31:23.465 --> 31:24.345
If you think it's good,

522
31:24.425 --> 31:26.065
I'd like to skip the internal review competition

523
31:26.145 --> 31:27.505
and present directly to Celestial.

524
31:27.585 --> 31:29.665
If Celestial rejects it, I'll resign.

525
31:38.665 --> 31:39.505
Xu Chi,

526
31:40.665 --> 31:43.065
have you thought about what happens if you fail?

527
31:44.025 --> 31:45.545
You're gambling with your career.

528
31:45.625 --> 31:46.865
I'm not gambling.

529
31:46.945 --> 31:49.345
I'm taking control of my own destiny.

530
31:50.385 --> 31:54.065
You awarded me the YangFan Cup championship trophy.

531
31:54.145 --> 31:56.745
So you know my talent and capabilities better than anyone.

532
31:58.305 --> 32:00.105
Ms. Sha was promoted by you.

533
32:00.185 --> 32:03.265
She says she loves ambitious, capable subordinates.

534
32:04.225 --> 32:05.225
I believe you do too.

535
32:13.025 --> 32:15.345
Congratulations. You won your gamble.

536
32:15.425 --> 32:18.705
And your presentation was even better than the slides I saw.

537
32:20.025 --> 32:23.265
We used to take a disruptive approach,

538
32:23.345 --> 32:24.745
constantly challenging our clients' existing systems.

539
32:24.825 --> 32:29.545
But most people push back when you try to overturn everything.

540
32:31.065 --> 32:35.065
They prefer validation and consensus from consultants.

541
32:35.145 --> 32:36.585
And what they really want is…

542
32:38.905 --> 32:40.665
What they really want is a solution

543
32:40.745 --> 32:42.865
-that truly addresses their anxieties. -Exactly.

544
32:44.465 --> 32:47.745
If the project moves forward smoothly, Maxmise as a whole

545
32:48.865 --> 32:49.865
benefits the most.

546
32:50.865 --> 32:53.745
But it's just a normal progression,

547
32:53.825 --> 32:56.545
so there won't be any bonus for you,

548
32:56.625 --> 32:59.105
and Ma Ke won't be penalized either.

549
33:01.705 --> 33:02.545
I understand.

550
33:03.225 --> 33:05.065
Company management is complicated.

551
33:05.145 --> 33:06.545
Too clean a system leaves no room for flexibility.

552
33:06.625 --> 33:07.905
And I just emphasized

553
33:07.985 --> 33:10.625
that the credit belongs to Ma Ke and the entire project team.

554
33:12.305 --> 33:14.505
Ma Ke is actually a smart guy.

555
33:14.585 --> 33:15.945
You helped him save face.

556
33:16.025 --> 33:17.185
He'll return the favor.

557
33:18.625 --> 33:19.465
You know what?

558
33:20.745 --> 33:22.385
You're bolder than anyone else.

559
33:23.425 --> 33:26.465
And you have a clearer vision for the future.

560
33:26.545 --> 33:27.505
So from now on,

561
33:28.105 --> 33:29.545
I'll hold you to a higher standard.

562
33:31.105 --> 33:32.185
What standard?

563
33:32.945 --> 33:36.425
Does that mean I can't use GPS to count sheep anymore?

564
33:36.505 --> 33:37.465
Switch to BeiDou?

565
33:38.865 --> 33:40.185
You know that joke too.

566
33:42.105 --> 33:44.345
Humor is actually a great weapon.

567
33:45.545 --> 33:47.505
Remember to use it more often.

568
33:56.865 --> 33:59.305
-Xu Chi. Congratulations. -Thanks.

569
33:59.905 --> 34:00.825
Well done, Xu Chi.

570
34:08.705 --> 34:09.865
Ma, you're back.

571
34:09.945 --> 34:11.505
Spare me the chatter. Get back to work.

572
34:19.784 --> 34:20.625
Chi.

573
34:21.865 --> 34:23.824
You're back. No. Sit down. Sit.

574
34:25.465 --> 34:27.744
Uh, let me talk to you.

575
34:34.465 --> 34:36.145
Well, come to my office.

576
34:38.505 --> 34:40.585
And, uh, no need to bring your laptop.

577
34:40.665 --> 34:41.905
Just got back. Pretty tired.

578
34:41.985 --> 34:42.985
Put the laptop down.

579
34:53.545 --> 34:55.865
She really stole the show this time.

580
34:55.945 --> 34:57.705
She came back in Mr. Pi's car.

581
34:58.865 --> 35:00.225
I heard Tianna had just finished

582
35:00.305 --> 35:02.225
when Xu Chi went straight up and started presenting.

583
35:02.305 --> 35:03.265
Everyone was stunned.

584
35:03.345 --> 35:05.745
But it worked really well. Absolutely crushed it.

585
35:07.625 --> 35:08.665
Zhao Heng.

586
35:09.305 --> 35:10.385
What about your princess?

587
35:10.465 --> 35:11.505
Aren't you going to check on her?

588
35:12.665 --> 35:14.545
A princess doesn't need comforting.

589
35:14.625 --> 35:17.865
Not like us, weak commoners.

590
35:29.305 --> 35:30.425
What a coincidence.

591
35:32.425 --> 35:33.265
Congratulations.

592
35:35.065 --> 35:35.945
Thanks.

593
35:37.745 --> 35:40.345
When I was watching you down there, I was actually pretty scared.

594
35:41.025 --> 35:41.905
Scared of what?

595
35:42.585 --> 35:44.025
Scared that if you get too good,

596
35:44.105 --> 35:45.945
you won't have dinner with me anymore.

597
35:48.025 --> 35:49.785
LET'S GO GET A GOOD MEAL LATER

598
35:56.585 --> 35:57.905
Depends on what we're eating.

599
36:04.945 --> 36:06.225
You came back this afternoon, right?

600
36:06.825 --> 36:07.905
Yeah.

601
36:07.985 --> 36:10.145
Tianhe is now with the project manager.

602
36:10.225 --> 36:11.265
From today on,

603
36:11.345 --> 36:13.985
I'm focusing on setting up the game with Wen Ruosen.

604
36:14.585 --> 36:16.385
Wen Ruosen screwed you over

605
36:16.465 --> 36:20.225
almost ten years ago, right?

606
36:20.305 --> 36:22.905
I bet he never imagined you'd still be holding onto this.

607
36:27.865 --> 36:28.825
Eat.

608
36:29.425 --> 36:31.345
Why are you on your phone while eating too?

609
36:31.425 --> 36:32.625
Put it down.

610
36:32.705 --> 36:34.425
Xu Chi sent me a file. I need to take a look.

611
36:36.345 --> 36:37.425
What did the girl send you?

612
36:39.905 --> 36:41.145
Pretty interesting.

613
36:42.425 --> 36:43.345
A few days ago,

614
36:43.425 --> 36:44.985
she ran into some issues on her project.

615
36:45.065 --> 36:46.505
I was going to help out,

616
36:46.585 --> 36:48.905
but she said she wanted to handle it on her own.

617
36:48.985 --> 36:50.185
She didn't tell me the details.

618
36:50.785 --> 36:51.785
I was worried.

619
36:51.865 --> 36:54.225
Then she just told me she'd resolved it perfectly.

620
36:54.305 --> 36:55.745
And she sent me the project summary.

621
36:56.625 --> 36:58.185
She can write project summaries now?

622
36:58.265 --> 36:59.105
3-STEP STRATEGY

623
36:59.185 --> 37:00.745
Not bad at all. Wow.

624
37:02.705 --> 37:05.185
Bold, smart, and measured.

625
37:05.265 --> 37:06.585
The younger generation is formidable.

626
37:06.665 --> 37:08.065
Come on. Cheers.

627
37:08.145 --> 37:09.745
Let's celebrate. That's a good one.

628
37:09.825 --> 37:12.465
You've basically raised a thoroughbred.

629
37:13.345 --> 37:14.745
I'm telling you,

630
37:15.625 --> 37:17.225
once you retire, you should just teach EMBA

631
37:17.305 --> 37:18.265
at a business school.

632
37:18.345 --> 37:20.225
Teaching isn't my thing.

633
37:20.305 --> 37:21.185
In all these years,

634
37:21.785 --> 37:22.825
I've only come across one person like her.

635
37:24.705 --> 37:27.345
Wipe that look off your face. That…

636
37:27.425 --> 37:29.385
That satisfied look. Get rid of it.

637
37:29.465 --> 37:31.105
It's disgusting.

638
37:31.825 --> 37:33.985
Now I get why you like her.

639
37:34.065 --> 37:36.825
Both of you got burned

640
37:36.905 --> 37:38.825
and betrayed by your bosses.

641
37:38.905 --> 37:40.505
Neither of you could swallow it,

642
37:40.585 --> 37:42.505
so you went straight for revenge.

643
37:42.585 --> 37:43.865
She succeeded.

644
37:44.985 --> 37:46.705
-But I haven't. -You admitted it.

645
37:48.345 --> 37:49.185
Admitted what?

646
37:49.265 --> 37:51.545
Admitted what? You admitted you like her.

647
37:51.625 --> 37:53.505
I just threw out a guess, and I got it out of you.

648
37:53.585 --> 37:55.345
You let your true feelings slip, didn't you?

649
37:58.945 --> 37:59.785
Drink up.

650
38:00.825 --> 38:02.785
Changing the subject. That just proves you admitted it.

651
38:02.865 --> 38:04.505
Just drink.

652
38:07.385 --> 38:10.025
Hey, what are you really thinking?

653
38:11.505 --> 38:12.905
You clearly fell for her,

654
38:12.985 --> 38:15.705
but you haven't realized it or figured it out.

655
38:15.785 --> 38:19.425
Do I have to knock some sense into you?

656
38:27.505 --> 38:29.425
Hey, you… Sit down. Listen to me.

657
38:29.505 --> 38:31.265
Let me ask you.

658
38:31.345 --> 38:33.625
When are you going to make it clear?

659
38:35.545 --> 38:36.545
Look at me.

660
38:37.905 --> 38:40.545
I know you don't want to hear this, but I have to say it.

661
39:12.225 --> 39:14.945
You clearly fell for her,

662
39:15.025 --> 39:16.305
but you haven't realized it

663
39:16.385 --> 39:17.985
or figured it out, right?

664
39:18.065 --> 39:19.825
Do I have to knock some sense into you?

665
39:33.145 --> 39:36.105
-Thanks. Drive safe. -Good night.

666
39:50.385 --> 39:54.665
UNDERGROUND PARKING ENTRANCE

667
39:56.505 --> 39:58.745
-What a coincidence. -Yeah.

668
39:59.545 --> 40:00.465
What a coincidence.

669
40:09.505 --> 40:12.105
-He is…? -My colleague.

670
40:12.185 --> 40:13.785
We're on the same project team.

671
40:15.545 --> 40:17.625
No wonder your Celestial project went so smoothly.

672
40:17.705 --> 40:19.265
So it's the power of love.

673
40:20.465 --> 40:21.985
What are you talking about?

674
40:22.065 --> 40:23.465
We were just having a meal.

675
40:23.545 --> 40:26.665
At most, it's a date.

676
40:26.745 --> 40:27.785
No need to be shy.

677
40:27.865 --> 40:32.425
I also find ways to unwind in my spare time.

678
40:36.865 --> 40:38.385
Right.

679
40:38.465 --> 40:42.105
Exactly. I remember you told me that to be a good consultant,

680
40:42.185 --> 40:44.585
you need to find an outlet for your emotions.

681
40:44.665 --> 40:46.585
So I learned fast.

682
40:49.265 --> 40:50.385
Good student.

683
40:56.065 --> 40:58.665
I still have a lot to learn from you.

684
40:59.305 --> 41:01.305
Like how to…

685
41:11.785 --> 41:14.185
A prize from the beer I just got. For you.

686
41:17.945 --> 41:19.505
I have a meeting.

687
41:19.585 --> 41:21.625
I'm heading off. Bye.
